k_unsatisfiable_guards(...)\nself.check_rebinding(...)\nself.check_unbound_variables(...)\nself.check_arg_not_accepted(...)\nself.check_return_types(...)\nself.check_exhaustiveness(...)\n```\n\nSo arg_not_accepted is checked before return_types. That's good. But I'm still outputting return_not_declared. Let me add some debug output:","time":{"start":1788997936206,"end":1788997943186}}}
