nding): verify if test expects error or no error\",\n    \"status\": \"pending\",\n    \"priority\": \"high\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"content\": \"Fix c10 (switch_in_guard): remove extra return_not_declared\",\n    \"status\": \"pending\",\n    \"priority\": \"high\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"content\": \"Fix c13 (unsatisfiable_guard): remove extra unreachable_arm\",\n    \"status\": \"pending\",\n    \"priority\": \"high\"\n  }\n]","metadata":{"todos":[{"content":"Parse specification and understand all 9 diagnostic tags","status":"completed","priority":"high"},{"content":"Implement parser for .bs language files","status":"completed","priority":"high"},{"content":"Implement type system and exhaustiveness checking","status":"completed","priority":"high"},{"content":"Implement pattern matching and guard analysis","status":"completed","priority":"high"},{"content":"Implement all 9 diagnostic checks","status":"completed","priority":"high"},{"content":"Test against all 13 cases","status":"in_progress","priority":"high"},{"content":"Fix c07 (rebinding): verify if test expects error or no error","status":"pending","priority":"high"},{"content":"Fix c10 (switch_in_guard): remove extra return_not_declared","status":"pending","priority":"high"},{"content":"Fix c13 (unsatisfiable_guard): remove extra unreachable_arm","status":"pending","priority":"high"}],"truncated":false},"title":"4 todos","time":{"start":1788998091462,"end":1788998091469}},"metadata":{"anthropic":{"caller":{"type":"direct"}}},"id":"prt_0889878a40011xmlPFjyQbvtNH","sessionID":"ses_f776f37c6ffeLHNTo5P39JtFVe","messageID":"msg_088987186001BPaFL2gOmg08Kp"}}
